        "input": {
          "instructions": "Professional, concise, and paced for an introductory course audience.",
          "text": "When every element is equally loud, the viewer must decide where to begin. Visual hierarchy makes that decision intentional. One element becomes the entry point, supporting information follows, and details settle into a readable order. The design is not merely decorated; attention is being organized."
